00:21:37.940 --> 00:21:39.290
W-Wait!

00:21:41.520 --> 00:21:44.400
Toujou! No...

00:22:03.380 --> 00:22:05.170
Sensei, what are you...

00:22:12.430 --> 00:22:18.060
Toujou, how about I let you experience the pleasure of an older woman more?

00:22:18.400 --> 00:22:20.250
Se-Sensei!

00:22:24.150 --> 00:22:26.740
Huh? What happened?

00:22:26.740 --> 00:22:28.700
Are you okay, Toujou?

00:22:28.700 --> 00:22:30.700
Sensei...

00:22:33.030 --> 00:22:34.450
I-I'm sorry!!

00:22:39.540 --> 00:22:44.340
I apologize. My mind went blank and I didn't even notice what happened to you.

00:22:44.590 --> 00:22:47.310
No, I'm sorry too.

00:22:49.230 --> 00:22:52.340
It looks like you let me sleep on your lap the entire time.

00:22:52.720 --> 00:22:53.850
I'm sorry.

00:22:55.560 --> 00:22:57.600
Um, Sensei?

00:22:57.810 --> 00:22:58.640
Hm?

00:22:59.270 --> 00:23:04.270
We took a bath and did some other things together, right?

00:23:07.150 --> 00:23:10.740
What, Toujou. Did you forget because of the heat?

00:23:10.740 --> 00:23:11.760
Eh?

00:23:13.450 --> 00:23:14.870
Yeah, as if.

00:23:20.540 --> 00:23:24.130
Your shirt's dry now. Sorry it took so long.

00:23:24.130 --> 00:23:25.630
Want me to drive you home?

00:23:27.960 --> 00:23:30.130
Uh, no it's okay.

00:23:32.340 --> 00:23:36.260
I have something I want to think about alone.

00:23:37.340 --> 00:23:38.810
A lot of things.
